name 'csp_unit1_lesson15_cfu2_dev_27_28'
title 'Deciding Who Gets Support'

question 'A school district wants software to help decide which students get extra support from a counselor. A mistake could mean a student who needs help is missed. Which of the following is the best way to use the software?'

wrong 'Let the software decide, because it is faster and more consistent than people.'
wrong 'Let the software decide whenever it is very confident.'
wrong 'Do not use software for decisions about students.'
right 'Let the software suggest students, and have counselors make the final decision.'

allow_multiple_attempts true